Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:21.37,EN,,0,0,0,,I think really staying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:21.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.61,EN,,0,0,0,,in the match never giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:23.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,留在比赛里 永不放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.19,EN,,0,0,0,,The first set was difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘确实很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:27.81,EN,,0,0,0,,and I had my chances so I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我也有过机会 所以我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:30.75,EN,,0,0,0,,that if I kept my concentration I would have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.81,0:00:30.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,只要我保持专注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:34.23,EN,,0,0,0,,more chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.75,0:00:34.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,机会还会再来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:39.31,EN,,0,0,0,,The first set was really difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.13,0:00:39.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一盘真的很难打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:42.21,EN,,0,0,0,,and I had my chances so I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:42.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也有过机会 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:44.95,EN,,0,0,0,,that if I kept my concentration I would have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:44.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,只要我保持专注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:48.09,EN,,0,0,0,,more chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.95,0:00:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,机会还会再来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.73,EN,,0,0,0,,And you saw a lot of your country's flags
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,现场有很多你们的国旗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:03.55,EN,,0,0,0,,and also the crowd was really rooting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.73,0:01:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且观众一直在为你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:04.29,EN,,0,0,0,,for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.55,0:01:04.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,加油助威
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:05.53,EN,,0,0,0,,How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:05.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:13.14,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.53,0:01:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:19.29,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much and see you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.14,0:01:19.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:20.11,EN,,0,0,0,,in the quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.29,0:01:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,四分之一决赛见
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:24.69,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:24.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:28.13,EN,,0,0,0,,Best of luck on your next match too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:28.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,也祝你下场好运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:29.31,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.13,0:01:29.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:30.81,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:30.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
